# power.scn: standby and the plain exit, shared by scenario_host and rt_test (pocketstation/tools/scenario.py).
# Author: suinevere
# The first standby runs in standby ticks with the tick line enabled: ticks latch but do not wake it, and the RTC's
# first rising edge does, its level showing it; the next idle delivers the tick, the RTC acknowledged first as every
# delivery does. The second, with only Up enabled, is woken by Up pressed as it begins. Each standby counts as an
# idle index for the inputs. The run ends leaving for the BIOS with mode 2.
enable 0x0100
tick 3
power 1
log_levels
idle 1
disable 0x0300
enable 0x0010
press 0x10 3
power 1
log_buttons
idle 1
release 0x10 5
idle 1
power 2
